tetro - folk copyleft note & permission
================================================

John Hardy, 2026.  **All wrongs reserved.**

**Authorship (informational):** the name and date identify who assembled this
snapshot. **All wrongs reserved** is whimsical wordplay (wrong ≠ rights); it is
not a proprietary *all rights reserved* claim nor any monopoly on copying or
derivatives. Taken together these lines carry **no** assertion of exclusive
ownership, exclusive rights, or control over distribution. Tiny Basic-era
hobby parlance borrowed **"copyleft"** only as camaraderie for sharing listings,
not FSF/GPL reciprocity.

There is intentionally no conventional "copyright (c)" notice.

Legal shape (effective grant matches **BSD Zero Clause / 0BSD**):

Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any purpose
with or without fee is hereby granted.

