TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, JOHN HARDY SHALL NOT BE
LIABLE FOR ANY SPECIAL, INDIRECT, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR INCIDENTAL
DAMAGES, OR LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, OR USE, ARISING OUT OF THIS SOFTWARE -
WHETHER IN TORT, NEGLIGENCE, CONTRACT, OR OTHERWISE - EVEN IF ADVISED THAT SUCH
LOSSES MAY OCCUR.
